{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experimental work simulator where all you do is type simple data into spreadsheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/02a75883013670f6ff0534e41d0e7740.webp?t=1763211328\" width=601 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.poster.avif?t=1763211328\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.webm?t=1763211328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/1a6da48a5aa2accd091ed1ee755384b4.mp4?t=1763211328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true joy and zen of a spreadsheet job without the worry of deadlines, bills, or deeper meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/3e6228b532272407d94c52adf3c9e97a.avif?t=1763211328\" width=601 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.poster.avif?t=1763211328\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.webm?t=1763211328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/0c5a54376b446a6f9bc2d9503a59786b.mp4?t=1763211328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get lost in the rhythm of your typing as you fill your 1.000 quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove humanity's strong will and finish this modern herculean task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/446299bebbc23090370675f25710e6f7.avif?t=1763211328\" width=600 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 90s inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing sound of rain easing you to the spreadsheet rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selected classical music as a non-intrusive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay so simple a baby could do it, but only a strong will could finish it</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Certified Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815990/82b07353f2b366f8f09f3dd393d46e14b21de2c4.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Monk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815990/88a753319ef6bd7ec6a3a1fb7f8fe678243de92b.jpg"},{"name":"50 Data","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815990/8bf07c59b27ae4b6dd1535f4588801dc00cb4ec0.jpg"},{"name":"100 Data","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815990/ea0a730259f99dbf86600b5682559aa6f92fc007.jpg"},{"name":"200 Data","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815990/ab9e6fd458b5e71aa615a3a6366a7963b6b0b43d.jpg"},{"name":"300 Data","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image